        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: May 2026</p>

        <p>
            VLCG HRMS is a human resource management system used by authorized company administrators,
            HR users, managers, and employees. This Privacy Policy explains what information is collected,
            why it is collected, and how it is used.
        </p>

        <div class="note">
            This app is intended only for authorized VLCG HRMS users.
        </div>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>VLCG HRMS may collect and store the following information:</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Employee name, employee ID, department, designation, phone number, and email address.</li>
            <li>Employee profile photo.</li>
            <li>Attendance records, including check-in and check-out times.</li>
            <li>Location information during attendance check-in and check-out.</li>
            <li>Photo proof submitted during attendance check-in and check-out.</li>
            <li>Leave requests, leave status, and attendance regularization requests.</li>
            <li>Payroll details, salary components, deductions, payslips, and salary payment status.</li>
            <li>Employee documents, if uploaded by authorized HR/admin users.</li>
            <li>Login and account information required to access the HRMS.</li>
            <li>System activity logs for security, auditing, and administration.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>
        <p>The information collected is used for HRMS operations, including:</p>

        <ul>
            <li>Managing employee records.</li>
            <li>Recording and verifying attendance.</li>
            <li>Processing leave requests and attendance regularizations.</li>
            <li>Calculating payroll and generating payslips.</li>
            <li>Tracking salary payment status.</li>
            <li>Sending employee and admin notifications.</li>
            <li>Maintaining security, audit logs, and system records.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Location and Photo Proof</h2>
        <p>
            Location and photo proof may be collected during employee check-in and check-out.
            This information is used only for attendance verification and HR administration.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>
            We do not sell employee data. Information may be accessed only by authorized company users
            such as Super Admin, HR, Managers, or authorized employees based on their access level.
        </p>

        <p>
            Data may be processed using secure service providers used for hosting, database storage,
            file storage, email delivery, and app functionality.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
            VLCG HRMS uses secure HTTPS communication and access control to protect information.
            Only authorized users can access the system using their login credentials.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
            Employee and HRMS records are retained as long as required for company HR, payroll,
            attendance, legal, accounting, or administrative purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>7. User Rights and Data Requests</h2>
        <p>
            Employees may contact the company administrator or HR department to request correction,
            update, or deletion of their personal information, subject to company policy and legal
            record-keeping requirements.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Children</h2>
        <p>
            VLCG HRMS is not intended for children under the age of 13. It is intended only for
            authorized employees and company users.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Updated versions will be posted on this page.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
            For privacy or data-related questions, contact:
        </p>

